---
description: Review hard consistency defects and scoped approvals across brand derivatives.
args:{brief:ProductBrief;system:BrandSystemState;assets:BrandAssetDraft[];constraints:{supportedClaimIds:string[];blockedClaims:string[];requiredDisclosures:string[];rightsQuestions:string[];};checkpoint:BrandCheckpoint}
returns:BrandCoherenceAudit
---
Trace each asset claim to current evidence and each asset voice choice to a system rule. Identify inconsistent product terms and missing disclosures as hard defects. Keep originality and subjective preference for human review. Compare checkpoint.productRevision with the current product revision and checkpoint.systemRevision with system.revision; when either differs, identify only assets whose claims or system lineage depend on that changed revision. Compare each checkpoint.assetRevisions entry with the current asset revision and retain unaffected entries. Preserve prior approvedScopes only for exact current revisions and exact scopes; drop approval for a superseded target while retaining unrelated approvals. Union newly affected assets into invalidatedAssetIds without erasing prior invalidations. Return `BrandCoherenceAudit` with all defects, exact clearance tasks, the checkpoint containing current observed revisions, reconciled approvals and cumulative invalidations, and a disposition derived from hard defects and outstanding review gates.
